  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity building of the Mozambique Supreme Audit Institution</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main activities will include: - development of a training program for each of the auditor profiles previously identified (Financial auditor, IT auditor, procurement auditor, public works auditor, value-for-money auditor) - identification of an external certification institution with internationally accepted standards - setting-up of certification process for TA auditors The objective of this project is to develop the capacity for the Mozambique Supreme Audit Institution (the Mozambican Tribunal Administrativo or TA) to provide its audit staff with internationally-accepted technical and professional training and certification. This would enable the TA to increase the effectiveness of its audits and contribute to increasing the transparency and accountability of the use of public funds in Mozambique.</narrative>
  </description>
